WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:04.700
It's almost Christmas Day.

00:04.700 --> 00:05.400
Yeah.

00:05.400 --> 00:08.030
I know there are a lot of 
people around right now,

00:08.030 --> 00:11.860
but there's one thing 
I can say with confidence.

00:12.240 --> 00:13.070
Huh?

00:14.280 --> 00:17.740
I'm definitely the happiest person here!

00:17.740 --> 00:22.480
Isn't that what you told me, Ryuto? 
To say exactly how I feel?

00:22.480 --> 00:26.210
Uh, yeah, that is... true, I guess.

00:26.210 --> 00:28.560
So I've made up my mind.

00:28.560 --> 00:32.200
I'm gonna to be totally open about 
how much I like you, Ryuto.

00:32.200 --> 00:33.170
Okay with you?

00:33.450 --> 00:35.130
Uh, sure.

00:35.130 --> 00:37.880
Hey, what should we do on Christmas Eve?

00:38.500 --> 00:41.390
Actually, there's something 
I've dreamed of doing.

00:41.390 --> 00:44.440
<i>D-Dreamed? I've dreamed of something, too!</i>

00:44.440 --> 00:48.100
<i>Ever since the day we started dating. 
The ultimate dream!</i>

00:49.110 --> 00:52.820
<i>I have to take advantage 
of the O Holy Night boost!</i>

00:52.820 --> 00:54.280
M-Me, too.

00:54.280 --> 00:55.740
If you're able to,

00:56.010 --> 00:58.950
I want you to help out with 
Operation: Double Wingman!

01:00.550 --> 01:01.450
Wha—?

01:14.420 --> 01:21.060
<b>Our Dating Story: 
The Experienced You and The Inexperienced Me</b>

02:33.000 --> 02:35.000
<b>Italian Restaurant</b>

02:33.000 --> 02:38.010
<b>Our Experience Story:</b>

02:33.520 --> 02:38.010
<b>The Experienced You and the</b>

02:34.020 --> 02:38.010
<b>Inexperienced Me Get Experienced.</b>

02:34.340 --> 02:35.000
So...

02:35.730 --> 02:38.010
Operation: Double Wingman?

02:38.010 --> 02:41.510
Maria and I are acting like 
normal sisters again, right?

02:41.510 --> 02:45.390
There's a dream I gave up on 
that I think I might come true now!

02:46.340 --> 02:50.220
My dream for us to all live together again!

02:50.810 --> 02:57.770
Obviously, Dad still loves Mom, and Mom
just got divorced, so she's single again.

02:57.770 --> 03:00.820
See? This is the perfect timing 
for them to get remarried!

03:00.820 --> 03:03.520
So you want to get them back together.

03:03.520 --> 03:05.580
But what can you do?

03:05.580 --> 03:07.630
I will use

03:07.630 --> 03:09.580
Operation: Double Wingman!

03:09.960 --> 03:12.540
It's from a book I read in elementary school.

03:12.950 --> 03:18.470
One day, two girls who look just like each 
other meet and realize that they're twins.

03:18.470 --> 03:23.050
Together, they set up all kinds of 
things to get their parents to meet,

03:23.620 --> 03:27.140
and at the end, they become 
one happy family again!

03:28.100 --> 03:33.600
I told Maria about it, and she said, "If you 
aren't willing to give up, we should try it!"

03:33.600 --> 03:37.390
And you're planning to launch 
the operation on Christmas Eve?

03:37.390 --> 03:42.060
Yeah! We're taking our parents 
out to meet as a surprise!

03:42.060 --> 03:46.870
If we all have dinner together again,
 they might remember how they felt, right?

03:46.870 --> 03:51.120
That makes sense. 
But don't you think I'll be in the way?

03:51.120 --> 03:54.520
No. I want you to come, Ryuto.

03:54.520 --> 03:59.520
Dad's really busy these days, 
so if I can't introduce him to my boyfriend,

03:59.520 --> 04:02.160
he won't have a reason to get out of work.

04:02.160 --> 04:03.430
Oh, I see.

04:03.430 --> 04:07.600
Grandma is away on vacation 
with her hula dance friends,

04:07.600 --> 04:11.430
so I'm really counting on you, 
Ryuto. Will you do it?

04:11.430 --> 04:14.580
All right. As long as I'm not in the way.

04:15.140 --> 04:17.450
Thank you! Let's give it a shot!

04:17.450 --> 04:21.440
Oh, maybe it would be fun for Maria 
and me to read letters to them.

04:23.950 --> 04:25.720
Let's see.

04:25.720 --> 04:31.720
"Dad and Mom, thanks for today. 
I knew you still had features for each other."

04:31.720 --> 04:34.460
I think you mean "feelings" 
for each other, don't you?

04:34.460 --> 04:36.810
Oh? Are you sure?

04:41.640 --> 04:43.550
Kasshi, good morning.

04:43.550 --> 04:45.640
Yeah. Morning, Icchi.

04:46.050 --> 04:46.840
Huh?

04:46.840 --> 04:48.220
What?!

04:49.360 --> 04:50.350
Ah!

04:53.430 --> 04:55.390
Uh... 'Sup.

04:55.390 --> 04:56.360
Huh?

04:56.800 --> 04:57.650
Wha—?!

05:03.400 --> 05:07.340
Hey! Isn't it crazy? Since when did
 Ijichi-kun look just like Lee Joon?

05:07.340 --> 05:09.100
My heart's pounding so hard right now!

05:09.100 --> 05:10.410
You're right.

05:10.410 --> 05:15.410
He lost weight when he took time off, 
so he does look a little different now.

05:15.410 --> 05:19.070
There's nothing little about it! 
They're both the same height, right?

05:19.070 --> 05:22.420
He's basically Lee Joon now! 
He's so my type, I just can't!

05:22.420 --> 05:24.860
So why don't you ask him out?

05:24.860 --> 05:26.050
Mm-hmm.

05:26.050 --> 05:27.800
Huh?

05:27.800 --> 05:30.320
No way! There's no way! No, no way!

05:30.320 --> 05:33.020
I totally wrecked him 
during the culture festival!

05:33.020 --> 05:36.540
If I go ask him out now, I would look lame!

05:36.540 --> 05:41.070
I'd look totally lame and pathetic! 
There's <i>seriously</i> no way!

05:41.070 --> 05:43.340
Yeah, no way! <i>Literally</i> no way!

05:43.340 --> 05:46.000
He's basically Lee Joon, but no way! 
No way, but he's Lee Joon!

05:46.000 --> 05:48.070
No way, no way! Lee Joon, Lee Joon!

05:46.630 --> 05:47.400
Hmm?

05:55.080 --> 05:58.080
<b></b>Friend List

05:55.080 --> 05:58.080
<b></b>Suzuki

05:55.080 --> 05:58.080
Seira

05:55.080 --> 05:58.080
Do you really want to block Sekiya Shugo? This will prevent you from receiving messages from this friend. To unblock later, go to [Settings] -> [Friends] -> [Block List].

05:55.080 --> 05:58.080
Cancel

05:55.080 --> 05:58.080
Block

05:59.990 --> 06:01.590
U-Um...

06:02.520 --> 06:03.720
What do you want?

06:03.720 --> 06:05.590
I just, uh...

06:05.980 --> 06:10.590
I-I realized our last names
 both end with a "na."

06:10.590 --> 06:11.500
Huh?

06:11.500 --> 06:17.770
Yeah, um, Nishina and Yamana. 
It must be fate, right?

06:17.770 --> 06:20.600
Is this your idea of hitting on me?

06:21.140 --> 06:23.360
You're way out of your league.

06:23.780 --> 06:26.100
Yeah, you might be right about that,

06:27.360 --> 06:30.360
but if I don't make a move, 
then nothing will ever happen.

06:33.760 --> 06:34.820
Sorry.

06:36.050 --> 06:37.930
I have a boyfriend.

06:38.870 --> 06:40.070
Yeah.

06:41.200 --> 06:42.520
I know.

06:46.130 --> 06:48.630
<i>They're in the springtime of their lives.</i>

06:48.630 --> 06:51.640
<i>They all have feelings for someone,</i>

06:52.210 --> 06:56.300
<i>even if those feelings only go one way.</i>

06:57.140 --> 07:00.140
<b><i>With a real value, the constant...</i></b>

06:57.140 --> 07:00.140
<b><i>Use the discriminant</i></b>

06:57.430 --> 07:00.140
You only have one year left before exams!

07:00.520 --> 07:02.900
Don't use Christmas Eve 
as an excuse to slack off!

07:04.040 --> 07:06.650
<i>Why didn't I realize until now?</i>

07:06.650 --> 07:09.900
<i>Meeting Runa's dad means that...</i>

07:10.290 --> 07:13.910
<i>I have to meet Runa's dad!</i>

07:13.990 --> 07:17.910
<b>Pressure</b>

07:14.210 --> 07:17.910
<i>That difficulty setting is too high 
for an introvert like me!</i>

07:22.520 --> 07:25.180
P-Pleased to meet you!

07:25.180 --> 07:28.920
Ru-Ru... Runa-san and I are da-da-dating.

07:28.920 --> 07:33.130
I'm Ka-Ka-Kashi... Ka-Kashi... 
Ka-Ka-Kashi... Ka-Ka-Kashi...

07:33.130 --> 07:34.680
What's this about cash?

07:36.850 --> 07:40.180
Yeah, well, I was just...

07:40.960 --> 07:42.150
Wanna go?

07:44.560 --> 07:46.320
It sure is cold.

07:46.320 --> 07:47.690
Are you warm enough?

07:47.690 --> 07:50.470
I am when we stay like this.

07:50.470 --> 07:52.700
Ah, I'm so nervous!

07:55.500 --> 07:56.820
Hi, Mom!

07:57.200 --> 08:01.210
Runa? And Ryuto-kun? What are you doing here?

08:01.210 --> 08:04.400
We wanted to celebrate Christmas with you.

08:04.400 --> 08:07.710
Huh? What's going on, Maria?

08:08.060 --> 08:10.080
We don't do it often enough.

08:10.080 --> 08:12.220
We are still a family, after all.

08:12.700 --> 08:14.830
Did you tell your father?

08:14.830 --> 08:18.890
We did kind of tell him, 
and he is kind of coming, so...

08:18.890 --> 08:21.230
Oh no. He's coming, too?

08:21.600 --> 08:23.530
I'm sorry we kept it from you.

08:23.530 --> 08:28.180
We wanted to have a Christmas 
party like the old days.

08:28.180 --> 08:32.550
If we told you Dad was coming, 
then you might not have come.

08:35.700 --> 08:40.220
You have a point there. 
He isn't someone I particularly want to see.

08:41.860 --> 08:47.040
But if you want us all together, 
that's different.

08:47.040 --> 08:50.520
I am an adult, after all. So is your father.

08:54.630 --> 08:56.760
The rest of your party has arrived.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.510
Oh.

08:59.850 --> 09:00.920
Akie?

09:06.720 --> 09:08.360
Who might that be?

09:12.920 --> 09:16.870
Well, Runa said she wanted to 
introduce me to her boyfriend,

09:17.280 --> 09:21.450
so I thought I should properly 
introduce someone myself.

09:24.800 --> 09:27.370
What? What do you mean?

09:27.850 --> 09:30.130
Are you getting remarried?

09:31.000 --> 09:32.880
Uh, yes.

09:39.560 --> 09:42.510
That's cruel! That's so cruel!

09:51.400 --> 09:53.660
There's nothing we can do, Runa.

09:53.660 --> 09:55.610
Let's spend more time together soon.

09:55.610 --> 09:57.030
You're welcome to visit anytime.

09:59.690 --> 10:02.910
Um, I'll make sure she gets home safely.

10:02.910 --> 10:06.790
Thank you, Ryuto-kun. 
Please take good care of my Runa.

10:14.600 --> 10:16.170
We should head home, too.

10:26.240 --> 10:27.140
Runa...

10:27.810 --> 10:30.810
<i>It had to be a huge shock for her.</i>

10:33.070 --> 10:37.070
I should... go home already.

10:39.490 --> 10:41.820
No. Don't go.

10:43.030 --> 10:45.830
Don't leave me alone tonight!

10:46.530 --> 10:48.830
<i>Wh-What did she say?</i>

10:49.200 --> 10:52.090
Y-You aren't alone, though.

10:52.090 --> 10:53.690
Y-Your dad will be here.

10:53.690 --> 10:57.080
He already said he had plans after dinner.

10:57.080 --> 10:59.780
I'm sure he's with that woman.

11:00.210 --> 11:01.660
No way...

11:02.570 --> 11:05.100
So I... please!

11:07.200 --> 11:09.610
W-We can't do this, Runa!

11:10.350 --> 11:12.380
But why not?

11:12.380 --> 11:15.690
W-Why? Um...

11:17.970 --> 11:23.690
<i>A-At a time like this, if I end up 
spending the night with her...!</i>

11:24.820 --> 11:27.120
No! We really shouldn't!

11:27.120 --> 11:30.570
<i>I made up my mind to respect Runa's intentions.</i>

11:30.570 --> 11:32.570
<i>To wait until </i>she<i> wants to do it!</i>

11:32.570 --> 11:34.890
How can you say that?

11:35.380 --> 11:38.140
Are you going to abandon me now, too?

11:43.300 --> 11:44.060
Whoa!

11:56.080 --> 11:57.400
Runa...?

12:06.990 --> 12:08.790
Ryuto...

12:08.790 --> 12:11.750
Ryuto, I don't mind if you take me.

12:13.500 --> 12:16.500
Just stay with me until morning.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.100
R-Ru...

12:23.820 --> 12:26.510
<i>Fine, then! Whatever happens, happens!</i>

12:27.250 --> 12:30.570
<i>Runa!</i>

12:31.810 --> 12:34.020
You feel hot. Runa?

12:34.860 --> 12:36.020
Whaeh?

12:36.480 --> 12:37.220
Hey!

12:39.940 --> 12:42.030
Wh-Where's the thermometer?!

12:43.280 --> 12:48.030
38.9 degrees? Wh-What should I do?

12:48.030 --> 12:49.790
Hospital? They're closed.

12:49.790 --> 12:51.290
Medicine? But where?

12:51.290 --> 12:54.790
A damp towel! But first I need to 
get her to her room!

12:54.790 --> 12:57.800
Whoa!

12:57.800 --> 13:00.310
I can smell you, Ryuto.

13:00.710 --> 13:02.620
It's such a nice smell.

13:02.620 --> 13:05.470
So relaxing...

13:05.470 --> 13:09.300
Hold on! Hey!

13:23.380 --> 13:26.740
<i>Okay. What do I have to do next?</i>

13:27.350 --> 13:31.990
Ryuto. I like you.

13:32.920 --> 13:33.980
Runa...

13:39.030 --> 13:41.250
<i>I want to protect you.</i>

13:46.550 --> 13:50.890
<i>The one and only girl in my life.</i>

13:57.260 --> 13:58.460
Thanks very much.

13:58.460 --> 13:59.690
Come back again.

14:07.040 --> 14:09.500
You! Demon Gyaru! Date me!

14:09.940 --> 14:12.140
Yeah, that's what I should tell her.

14:20.320 --> 14:21.760
Nicole-chan.

14:21.760 --> 14:22.670
Boss?

14:22.670 --> 14:25.150
It's early, but you can call it a night.

14:25.150 --> 14:27.800
I doubt we'll get any other customers.

14:27.800 --> 14:29.030
Appreciate it.

14:30.210 --> 14:31.430
Take care!

14:37.880 --> 14:39.530
<i>If I don't do something,</i>

14:40.400 --> 14:42.230
<i>I won't get anywhere!</i>

14:53.950 --> 14:55.340
Good evening.

14:53.950 --> 14:57.950
<b>Receptionist</b>

14:56.980 --> 14:57.950
Hey, wait!

15:00.460 --> 15:01.780
What?

15:09.790 --> 15:10.980
Whoa!

15:18.070 --> 15:19.730
I'm going to wait for you.

15:20.110 --> 15:22.440
I'll wait until your exams are over.

15:22.440 --> 15:25.220
And if you tell me not to, I won't listen!

15:40.160 --> 15:41.350
Phew.

15:41.350 --> 15:42.340
Hey!

15:46.340 --> 15:51.260
You have your say and then just run off? 
What the hell do you think you're doing?

15:53.140 --> 15:54.740
I apologize.

16:04.670 --> 16:06.280
Senpai...

16:24.540 --> 16:27.550
<i>Hey, Nisshi! Where the hell are you?</i>

16:27.550 --> 16:29.800
<i>KEN's live stream is about to start!</i>

16:29.800 --> 16:31.720
Oh, shit!

16:32.300 --> 16:33.980
I'm heading home now!

16:35.410 --> 16:36.550
<i>Hey, guys! KEN here!</i>

16:36.550 --> 16:39.850
All right, all right! 
This one's an all-nighter!

16:39.850 --> 16:43.180
KEN, KEN, KEN, KEN,
 KEN, KEN, KEN, KEN, KEN! Woo-hoo!

16:48.170 --> 16:50.320
He looks exactly like him!

16:51.240 --> 16:53.700
I hope Runa is okay.

16:53.700 --> 17:00.700
She's so sensitive and kind. 
That part of her is just like Kashima-kun.

17:01.330 --> 17:03.960
Really. They're a perfect match.

17:12.770 --> 17:13.800
You okay?

17:13.800 --> 17:14.970
Yeah!

17:15.480 --> 17:17.970
The fever's gone down a lot.

17:18.330 --> 17:20.630
Well, don't overdo it.

17:20.630 --> 17:21.470
Okay.

17:21.960 --> 17:26.980
I'm so happy! I even get to spend 
Christmas morning with you!

17:26.980 --> 17:29.420
Uh... m-me, too.

17:29.420 --> 17:31.730
Oh, right! I have something.

17:32.010 --> 17:34.740
Here! Your Christmas present.

17:36.740 --> 17:38.600
Open it, open it!

17:38.600 --> 17:40.020
Ah. Okay.

17:40.740 --> 17:43.370
<b>Success
 in Love</b>

17:40.740 --> 17:44.250
<b>Traffic Safety</b>

17:40.740 --> 17:44.250
<b>Academic 
Achievement</b>

17:40.740 --> 17:44.250
<b>Good Fortune</b>

17:41.560 --> 17:44.250
Good luck... charms?

17:41.990 --> 17:44.250
<b>Successful Exams</b>

17:42.240 --> 17:44.250
<b>Booming Business</b>

17:44.250 --> 17:48.750
At first, I was just going to get you one 
for studying, but Nicole said...

17:49.440 --> 17:52.360
If all he does is study, won't he get worn out?

17:52.360 --> 17:53.110
See?

17:55.400 --> 17:59.150
Thank you, Runa! I'll carry them all.

17:59.150 --> 18:01.260
I need all the luck I can get.

18:03.380 --> 18:05.720
I've got a present for you, too.

18:06.470 --> 18:07.300
Oh?

18:09.080 --> 18:13.360
Ta-da! Merry Christmas!

18:17.650 --> 18:19.610
<i>Oh, crap! It bombed!</i>

18:19.610 --> 18:20.460
Uh...

18:24.950 --> 18:28.330
My dad used to do the exact same gag!

18:28.330 --> 18:30.720
Ah! I-I'm sorry!

18:30.720 --> 18:32.360
Um, here!

18:32.890 --> 18:34.970
Ahh, what is it?

18:35.960 --> 18:39.000
Oh. Earrings?

18:39.000 --> 18:40.820
They match my ring!

18:41.760 --> 18:44.390
It was moonstone, right?

18:45.010 --> 18:47.210
They had the same gem, so...

18:47.210 --> 18:48.890
Huh? Runa?

18:49.650 --> 18:53.270
I guess my Santa isn't my dad anymore.

18:54.010 --> 18:55.150
Huh?

18:55.150 --> 18:58.820
The person who brings me 
happiness now is you, Ryuto.

19:00.660 --> 19:04.220
Thank you, Ryuto! I'll be okay now.

19:04.680 --> 19:08.660
I think I'll be able to accept 
Dad's happiness, too.

19:10.840 --> 19:11.750
Mm-hmm!

19:12.820 --> 19:15.900
<i>We still have a long ways to go.</i>

19:15.900 --> 19:21.430
<i>Life is full of bitterness, pain, and other 
things we don't know anything about yet.</i>

19:22.320 --> 19:26.430
<i>Despite that, we'll treasure the blessings we 
have before us and keep moving forward,</i>

19:27.640 --> 19:29.430
<i>to keep laughing together,</i>

19:30.480 --> 19:31.830
<i>forever and ever.</i>

19:36.270 --> 19:38.190
Huh? Seriously?

19:38.640 --> 19:40.430
I guess we've both been through a lot, then.

19:40.430 --> 19:44.450
<i>No kidding. It turned into 
one unforgettable Christmas.</i>

19:44.830 --> 19:45.820
Yeah.

19:45.820 --> 19:48.840
<i>But you know, there's still 
one thing bothering me.</i>

19:48.840 --> 19:49.700
What's that?

19:49.700 --> 19:54.350
Yesterday, Ryuto didn't try 
to do anything dirty with me.

19:54.350 --> 19:55.470
<i>Huh?</i>

19:55.470 --> 19:56.710
Isn't that strange?

19:57.070 --> 20:00.280
When he spends Christmas Eve alone with 
the girlfriend he's totally got the hots for?

20:00.280 --> 20:03.400
<i>Well, that's probably because you had a fever.</i>

20:03.400 --> 20:05.260
True, but still...

20:05.260 --> 20:08.890
Wait a minute, Runa. 
Does this mean you finally want to do it?

20:08.890 --> 20:12.230
Huh? M-Maybe it does.

20:12.680 --> 20:14.230
I don't know!

20:14.790 --> 20:19.150
But, I mean, I think about it a lot. 
All sorts of stuff.

20:19.150 --> 20:23.240
Like, I might be fantasizing 
about Ryuto a lot these days.

20:23.240 --> 20:24.740
<i>Oh, indeed?</i>

20:24.740 --> 20:27.210
Well, perhaps that is love.

20:27.210 --> 20:28.040
<i>Huh?</i>

20:28.040 --> 20:33.080
Until now, you worked hard to like 
the guys who said they liked you.

20:33.560 --> 20:37.380
None of those were true love, though.

20:37.380 --> 20:38.500
<i>Hmm...</i>

20:38.500 --> 20:42.570
But now you've finally encountered true love,

20:42.570 --> 20:44.810
for the first time, with Kashima Ryuto.

20:44.810 --> 20:46.260
<i>First time?</i>

20:49.060 --> 20:55.600
That's right. I do still have a "first time" 
that I can share with Ryuto!

22:34.120 --> 22:36.480
Ryuto! Right here, right here!

22:36.480 --> 22:39.580
I-I've actually never done print club before.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.040
<b>Print Club Park</b>

22:38.870 --> 22:40.040
<b>Tokyo's Largest</b>

22:41.460 --> 22:43.040
Don't worry!

22:43.620 --> 22:45.500
I'll take the lead.

22:46.050 --> 22:47.940
O-Okay.

22:54.070 --> 22:57.310
Hey, hey. Are you into 
cosplay and stuff, Ryuto?

22:57.310 --> 23:02.110
Uh, I-I can't exactly say I'm a huge fan...

